   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rehabilitation of sites CHIII-UNDP-KOS-00128090</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under the auspices of the Cultural Heritage a Driver for Inter Community Dialogue and Social cohesion project, 21 sites of important cultural and religious heritage value will have been restored.The project will fully renovate three sites including the Sahat Kulla/Clock Tower in Prishtine/Pristina, the house in Mitrovica and the mosque in Drenovc/Drenovce village in Decan/Decani municipality. The activities will be conducted jointly with the Ministry of Culture, Youth and Sports (house in Mitrov</narrative>
  </description>
